		</Group>
		<RichText x="1410" y="223" width="425" height="85" d:userLabel="仆↓人进行至多5段的普通攻击，其依次造成2" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">若娜瓦窃取角色的灵魂，并使队伍进入「裂魂」状态，同时抽走<span color="#ffdfbf">60%</span><span>的</span><span textDecoration="underline">「性命」</span><span>。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="1410" y="447" width="424" height="85" d:userLabel="仆↓人进行至多5段的普通攻击，其依次造成2" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">若娜瓦施放交叉状的朱赤羽击，均造成<span color="#ff9999">50%</span><span>伤害。该朱赤羽击还会在角色陷入「裂魂」状态下周期性出现。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="1410" y="671" width="424" height="56" d:userLabel="仆↓人进行至多5段的普通攻击，其依次造成2" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">若娜瓦在角色处召出死花，随后在圆形范围内盛开，造成<span color="#ff9999">100%</span><span>伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="1410" y="895" width="433" height="85" d:userLabel="仆↓人进行至多5段的普通攻击，其依次造成2" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">当某一角色的「性命」降至2%时，若娜瓦迅速抓起该角色，并将其生命值消耗至<span color="#ffbfbf">6%</span><span>，之后的消耗过程将被戴因截断。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="1410" y="1119" width="422" height="114" d:userLabel="仆↓人进行至多5段的普通攻击，其依次造成2" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">若娜瓦在周身处召唤3只环绕自身的黑鸦，并产生血浪，造成<span color="#ff9999">50%</span><span>伤害。黑鸦会在若娜瓦每次翻身时释放追踪玩家，每只造成</span><span color="#ff9999">66%</span><span>伤害；黑鸦</span><span color="#ffdfbf">2.5s</span><span>后消失。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="1410" y="1343" width="438" height="114" d:userLabel="仆↓人进行至多5段的普通攻击，其依次造成2" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">若娜瓦在角色处召出死花，随后在圆形范围内盛开，造成<span color="#ff9999">100%</span><span>伤害，盛开产生的残烟形成火龙卷，触碰持续造成</span><span color="#ff9999">10%</span><span>伤害，火龙卷会缓缓向玩家位置移动。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="1410" y="1567" width="424" height="56" d:userLabel="仆↓人进行至多5段的普通攻击，其依次造成2" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">若娜瓦召唤死之鸦，令其重重坠地，造成<span color="#ff9999">100%</span><span>伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="1410" y="1791" width="424" height="85" d:userLabel="仆↓人进行至多5段的普通攻击，其依次造成2" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">若娜瓦摧毁场地上所有的灾厄之眼和火龙卷，分别造成<span color="#ff9999">60%</span><span>与</span><span color="#ff9999">80%</span><span>伤害，同时释放所有的随身黑鸦。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<BitmapImage source="@Embed('/若娜瓦.assets/Image_14.png')" x="1391" y="138">
		</BitmapImage>
