		</BitmapImage>
		<RichText x="899" y="62" fontFamily="造字工房悦圆 G0v1 常规体" fontSize="24" fontStyle="normal" fontWeight="normal" color="#ad4218" width="207" height="28" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="1">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="造字工房悦圆 G0v1 常规体" fontSize="24" color="#ad4218">制图@Csxylic米游社</p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="66" y="1328" width="433" height="78" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.7490196078431373">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="16" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">「性命」：初始被若娜瓦重置为<span color="#ffdfbf">50%</span><span>，「裂魂」状态下每秒流失</span><span color="#ffdfbf">3%</span><span>，受到若娜瓦攻击</span><span color="#ffdfbf">-15%</span><span>，获得灵魂「生命」时</span><span color="#ffdfbf">+20%</span><span>，「魂止生息渡」技能</span><span color="#ffdfbf">-60%</span><span>。当该值降至2%时会被若娜瓦抓住，并被抽走真正的生命值。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="67" y="1408" fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="16" fontStyle="normal" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff" width="278" height="20" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.7490196078431373">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="16" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">降格：若娜瓦被没收死之权能后的技能。</p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="223" width="424" height="85" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">若娜瓦入场，扬起血浪，并产生沿八个方向扩散的数个地喷，均造成<span color="#ff9999">60%</span><span>伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="447" width="424" height="56" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">若娜瓦展开蕴含赤月之力的眼翼，并发射6枚血弹，均造成<span color="#ff9999">25%</span><span>伤害；</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="671" width="398" height="56" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">若娜瓦召唤数个呈直线方向扩散的地喷，均造成<span color="#ff9999">60%</span><span>伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="1119" fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontStyle="normal" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff" width="408" height="56" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">若娜瓦升至空中，使用「死之权能」，将在场角色送入死后世界。</p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="1343" width="423" height="114" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">若娜瓦召唤数个呈直线方向扩散的大型地喷，均造成<span color="#ff9999">60%</span><span>伤害，同时每个地喷都会留下灾厄之眼，触碰持续造成</span><span color="#ff9999">20%</span><span>伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="1567" width="423" height="56" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">处于若娜瓦后方时，若娜瓦挥手发射一群平飞的黑鸦，造成<span color="#ff9999">66%</span><span>伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="1791" width="424" height="56" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">若娜瓦持续将玩家牵引至面前，随后发动气爆，造成<span color="#ff9999">70%</span><span>伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="2015" width="986" height="114" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">若娜瓦将角色传至面前，施放「死之洪流」，将该角色<span color="#ffbfbf">(除主角外)</span><span>的灵魂裂分为3个「生命」，同时使队伍进入「裂魂」状态：队伍的血条替换为特殊的</span><span color="#ffdfbf">「性命」条</span><span>，并重置为50%；朱赤羽击将不断出现在玩家附近，且玩家</span><span color="#ffdfbf">不能够切换角色</span><span>；</span><span color="#ffcdbf">20s</span><span>后结束「裂魂」状态。<br/>主角免疫「裂魂」效果。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="739" y="895" width="423" height="56" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">靠近若娜瓦时，会触发近身血浪，造成<span color="#ff9999">100%</span><span>伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
